# Bare `krowk` in the full build opens the TUI only when a person is at a
# terminal: stdin and stdout both a TTY. Everywhere else it prints exactly
# what it printed before the TUI existed. These were recorded from the full
# build of the commit before it, so any difference is a behaviour change.
krowk
krowk --json
krowk --format human
@stdin hello\n
krowk
@tty krowk
@tty krowk --json
@tty krowk --resume
@tty krowk --model claude-x
